   "text": "Each band is one stage. Read it left to right: context, input, mechanism, refusal, output. Horizontal arrows order\nthe reading, not a dependency; the middle column is the spine, and following it down traces one request from a\nquestion to a stored event. A refusal is a designed outcome, not a missing arrow. Bands 02\u201315 are that path; 16\u201317\nstores beside it. The laws: a citation is exact text, never a summary; a challenge narrows, never confirms; every\ntraversal names its limit; the candidate generator sees a projection, not state; INCONCLUSIVE is the only signed\nclassification. Everything below the mechanism column is a contract, and every contract here refuses something.",
   "originalText": "Each band is one stage. Read it left to right: context, input, mechanism, refusal, output. Horizontal arrows order\nthe reading, not a dependency; the middle column is the spine, and following it down traces one request from a\nquestion to a stored event. A refusal is a designed outcome, not a missing arrow. Bands 02\u201315 are that path; 16\u201317\nstores beside it. The laws: a citation is exact text, never a summary; a challenge narrows, never confirms; every\ntraversal names its limit; the candidate generator sees a projection, not state; INCONCLUSIVE is the only signed\nclassification. Everything below the mechanism column is a contract, and every contract here refuses something.",
